---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Contact Relocate Works — Questions, Feedback and Partnership Requests"
  description="Contact Relocate Works for feedback, correction requests, partnership questions, relocation resource suggestions, and weekly visa sponsor job list inquiries."
  canonicalPath="/contact"
>
  <Header />
  <main>
    <section class="page-hero page-hero-gradient">
      <div class="container">
        <span class="eyebrow">Contact</span>
        <h1>Contact Relocate Works.</h1>
        <p class="lead">Have feedback, a correction, a country request, a relocation resource suggestion, or a question about the paid weekly sponsor job list? Send a message and include clear context.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container prose">
        <h2>AI opportunity questions and corrections</h2><p>To report an outdated opportunity or broken referral destination, send the page URL and supporting source to the contact email above. Please do not send resumes, identity documents or private application details. For screening, payments, contracts or application status, contact the hiring platform directly.</p>
        <h2>Best ways to contact us</h2>
        <p>
          Relocate Works is an early-stage project, so contact may be handled manually. The fastest way to get a useful reply is to include a clear subject, the country or page you are asking about, and the specific issue or request.
        </p>
        <div class="detail-grid">
          <div><strong>General questions</strong><span>Ask about the website, newsletter, country guides, job research format, or future product direction.</span></div>
          <div><strong>Corrections</strong><span>Send outdated visa notes, broken links, incorrect country details, or salary/cost information that should be reviewed.</span></div>
          <div><strong>Country requests</strong><span>Suggest new countries, cities, visa routes, job sectors, or relocation topics that should be added.</span></div>
          <div><strong>Partnerships</strong><span>Relocation companies, career services, immigration professionals, and employer brands can contact us about possible collaboration.</span></div>
        </div>

        <h2>Email</h2>
        <p>
          Current contact email: <strong>{SITE.email}</strong>
        </p>
        <p>
          If you are reporting a correction, please include the page URL, the exact section, the correction you recommend, and a source if available.
        </p>

        <h2>Questions about visa or immigration advice</h2>
        <p>
          Relocate Works cannot provide personalized visa advice, legal immigration advice, eligibility assessment, document review, or official application support. For personal immigration matters, contact official government sources or qualified immigration professionals.
        </p>

        <h2>Questions about jobs</h2>
        <p>
          Relocate Works does not employ candidates, represent employers, or guarantee sponsor availability. If a job is mentioned in a future job list, candidates must verify details directly with the employer or recruiter before applying.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
